  "selection_rule": "Per battle a seeded RNG (seed*1000+battle index) draws early (turn 2-5), mid (6-14) and late (15-25) targets; snapshot the first decision round whose upcoming turn >= target. Also the first forced-switch round and up to 2 Revival-Blessing 'reviving' rounds (exempt from the per-battle budget of 5). One extra slot per battle: even battle index = first round with the learner's Cramorant active and Surf/Dive legal; odd index = first round (turn>=2) where p1 can Terastallize, in which the ORIGINAL run is forced to Terastallize (stress). Global cap 50. Decision round = a pending non-wait, non-teampreview request exists. Window = 3 rounds.",
  "normalisations": [
    "battle id (frame header '>battle-gen9ou-N' -> '>battle-gen9ou-<TAG>')",
    "|t:|<unix seconds> protocol lines -> '|t:|' (frames, omniscient channel, sim toJSON log)",
    "end-event `seed` field is dropped from the end payload comparison",
    "rqid is NOT normalised (the room-wide counter is part of the checkpoint)"
  ],
